{"id":"n15306-1-8","stage":3,"title":"가뭄 · 干旱","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15306-1-8-1","ko":"오늘은 전국에 비가 온다네.","zh":"听说今天全国都会下雨呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전국에","meaning":"全国","explanation":"전국：全国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전국","audio":"/audio/9269373d05d5697512ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62412","senseId":"1","lemma":"전국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온다네.","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；ㄴ다네：向平辈或晚辈说明自己知道或听到的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"9269373d05d56975","term":"전국","zh":"全国","audio":"/audio/9269373d05d5697512ee.mp3","entryId":"62412","definition":"整个国家全体。","pronunciation":["전국"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/775b383b337cb4387340.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15306-1-8-2","ko":"남쪽 지방에 가뭄이 들었다던데 비가 온다니 다행이야.","zh":"听说南部地区正在干旱，今天能下雨真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남쪽","meaning":"南侧，南边，南方","explanation":"남쪽：南侧，南边，南方","readings":[{"term":"남쪽","audio":"/audio/aa6ac947e28f5dad655c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63619","senseId":"1","lemma":"남쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지방에","meaning":"地区","explanation":"지방：地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지방","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71323","senseId":"1","lemma":"지방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가뭄이","meaning":"干旱","explanation":"가뭄：干旱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가뭄","audio":"/audio/2f438a9da5252a2eac3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15306","senseId":"1","lemma":"가뭄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었다던데","meaning":"遇，逢，遭受","explanation":"들다：遇，逢，遭受；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다던데：回顾听来的内容，作为后文的背景、对照或判断依据。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"12","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온다니","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；ㄴ다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다행이야.","meaning":"万幸，幸事，走运","explanation":"다행：万幸，幸事，走运；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"다행","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28359","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aa6ac947e28f5dad","term":"남쪽","zh":"南侧，南边，南方","audio":"/audio/aa6ac947e28f5dad655c.mp3","entryId":"63619","definition":"四个方位之一，指南针上“S”极所示的方向。","pronunciation":["남쪽"]},{"id":"aa8a6ab7ce21201d","term":"지방","zh":"地区","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3","entryId":"71323","definition":"根据行政划分或某种特征而划分的区域。","pronunciation":["지방"]},{"id":"2f438a9da5252a2e","term":"가뭄","zh":"干旱","audio":"/audio/2f438a9da5252a2eac3f.mp3","entryId":"15306","definition":"长时间不下雨的天气。","pronunciation":["가뭄"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"遇，逢，遭受","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"因天气因素而发生某事或现象。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"c1308a8fe6495062","term":"다행","zh":"万幸，幸事，走运","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3","entryId":"28359","definition":"意外地运气好。","pronunciation":["다행"]}],"audio":"/audio/433360f64919f0c054a7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.733,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15306","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4583,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说南部地区正在干旱，今天能下雨真是太好了。","听说今天全国都会下雨呢。","你一直吵个不停，我根本没法集中注意力啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说今天全国都会下雨呢。","你一直吵个不停，我根本没法集中注意力啊。","听说南部地区正在干旱，今天能下雨真是太好了。"],"answer":2}]}
